---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Squiggle from '../components/Squiggle.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service — VisualCraft"
  description="Review the simple, open-source Terms of Service for VisualCraft. Understand your rights for prompt generation and commercial usage."
>
  <!-- Hero banner -->
  <section class="bg-cream pt-16 pb-12 md:py-20 border-b border-cream-darker/30 relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Floating background sparkles -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40">
      <div class="absolute top-12 left-10 w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent-pink animate-float"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-accent-lavender animate-float delay-300"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container-page relative text-center max-w-3xl">
      <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
        <span class="pill-cream">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent-pink animate-pulse"></span>
          User Agreement
        </span>
      </div>
      
      <h1 class="headline-display">
        Terms of <em>Service</em>
      </h1>
      
      <p class="mt-6 body-lg text-ink-secondary">
        Simple and straightforward terms for using our open-source visualization prompt utility.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-tertiary">
        Last updated: June 28, 2026
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center">
        <Squiggle color="#B5A5F0" width="100" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content Section -->
  <section class="section bg-cream-lighter py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <div class="prose prose-cream max-w-none text-ink-secondary space-y-8 leading-relaxed">
        
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-ink-primary">
            1. Acceptance of Terms
          </h2>
          <p>
            By accessing or using the VisualCraft website (located at `https://visualcraft.pages.dev`), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the application.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-ink-primary">
            2. License & Intellectual Property
          </h2>
          <p>
            The software, layout, and original code of VisualCraft are released under the open-source **MIT License**. You are welcome to view, copy, edit, distribute, or compile the source code for any personal or commercial project.
          </p>
          <p>
            The prompt generation patterns, visualization layout suggestions, and palette combinations are provided as-is to help you structure descriptions for AI tools.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-ink-primary">
            3. Ownership of Generated Content
          </h2>
          <p>
            **We claim zero ownership or copyright over any text prompts you construct** using our tools. Any prompt text you copy is 100% yours to modify, save, use, and sell.
          </p>
          <p>
            Note that any final graphic, diagram, or text output generated by sending these prompts to third-party tools (such as Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, or Midjourney) is subject to your licensing agreements with those respective platforms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-ink-primary">
            4. Permitted & Prohibited Uses
          </h2>
          <p>
            VisualCraft is built to help professionals, researchers, students, and creators build visual materials. You are permitted to use this site for any lawful purpose.
          </p>
          <p>
            You agree not to:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>
              Attempt to disrupt the availability of this static website through distributed denial-of-service (DDoS) methods or other server abuse.
            </li>
            <li>
              Mirror or host malicious code under our domain name.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-ink-primary">
            5. Disclaimer of Warranties
          </h2>
          <p class="italic text-ink-tertiary">
            THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-ink-primary">
            6. Limitation of Liability
          </h2>
          <p>
            VisualCraft does not host or execute AI graphics models locally. We serve solely as a front-end prompt constructor. We will not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from your use of the generated prompts or outputs from third-party AI models.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-ink-primary">
            7. Governing Law
          </h2>
          <p>
            Any disputes arising from your use of the website shall be governed by local laws without regard to conflict of law principles.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
